# Routes Documentation

## Overview
This directory contains the route definitions for the EduConnect application's presentation layer.

## Purpose
- Defines API endpoints and request handling
- Maps HTTP requests to appropriate controllers
- Manages request/response flow for the backend service

## Structure
Routes are organized by feature or resource type, with each route file handling a specific domain of the application.

## Usage
Import route files in the main application entry point to register all endpoints.

## Adding New Routes
1. Create a new route file in this directory
2. Define endpoint handlers and middleware
3. Export the route definition
4. Import and register in the application configuration
